# WHAT A WARDEN HOLDS (docs/interiors, 21_doors, HallTurret): while it stands,
# the strongboxes in the bays will not open, and the turrets high in the hall's
# corners turn on whoever is in their line -- the eye burns hot as one comes
# round, the tell to move on. (Broken, it lets go of both: tests/interior proves
# the boxes pay out the hall's table once, through the one economy.)
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/hall-guard.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the key at a strongbox while the warden stands, and the glass saying why
# it is shut. 02 is a turret come round on the player, its eye hot.
coast calm
near door:weapons_hall
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:weapons_hall 5
# A crossing spends the key for a moment (20_realms SETTLE), less time than the
# walk to the bays takes; a tour's teleport is quicker, so it waits.
near strongbox
wait 0.8
press use 0.1
await box_refused 3
wait 0.2
shot 01-a-strongbox-shut-while-the-warden-stands with inside:weapons_hall,box_near,mob:warden
# A turret cannot see into a bay (its line would leave the floor through the
# bay's wall), so step back out into the hall, where every corner can.
near door
await turret_aiming 10
shot 02-a-turret-comes-round-its-eye-hot with inside:weapons_hall,turret_aiming
